    "summary": "Astra single-pass source recovery. All 22 original question/key pages personally read; original underlying PDF text inspected where Grid 6 diagram overlays formulas. Ten independent original problems and IDs retained. Eight matching supplied keys and two explicitly separated related variants. All ten final no-snap figure crops personally inspected. No separate model checker.",
